#*
# Launch 2x scaled Google Chrome for screen sharing while using UHD/4K
# monitors. This is put in a separate script so that it can be launched from
# the fzf-launcher or any other application launcher.
#**

#* USAGE:
#*   ${0}
#**
google-chrome-stable --force-device-scale-factor=2
